    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Virtual Filesystem (VFS)",
      "source_hash": 16307231816769992692,
      "context_hash": 8328764830122949624,
      "translation": "가상 파일시스템(VFS)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel's filesystem abstraction layer",
      "source_hash": 16635288465742207224,
      "context_hash": 14285328722714352012,
      "translation": "커널의 파일시스템 추상화 계층",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447663Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What is VFS?",
      "source_hash": 11658665123720461626,
      "context_hash": 9824460130949158377,
      "translation": "VFS란 무엇인가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447663Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Virtual Filesystem Switch (VFS) is an abstraction layer that allows the kernel to support many different filesystems (ext4, btrfs, tmpfs, procfs, NFS...) through a common interface.",
      "source_hash": 13526284475272306562,
      "context_hash": 13704488888400053114,
      "translation": "VFS(Virtual Filesystem Switch)는 커널이 공통 인터페이스를 통해 다양한 파일시스템(ext4, btrfs, tmpfs, procfs, NFS 등)을 지원할 수 있게 하는 추상화 계층입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS",
        "btrfs": "btrfs",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "tmpfs": "tmpfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447664Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "When your program calls `read()`, it goes through VFS, which dispatches to the appropriate filesystem implementation.",
      "source_hash": 15565375185827144268,
      "context_hash": 10547795256027949726,
      "translation": "프로그램이 `read()`를 호출하면 그 호출은 VFS를 거치며, VFS는 이를 해당 파일시스템 구현으로 디스패치합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447664Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "VFS makes the following possible:",
      "source_hash": 1770401595690790553,
      "context_hash": 14655796205697006418,
      "translation": "VFS는 다음을 가능하게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447664Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A single `open()`, `read()`, `write()` API works for ext4, NFS, /proc, /sys, pipes, and sockets",
      "source_hash": 11646423784462970587,
      "context_hash": 16028903778891826633,
      "translation": "하나의 `open()`, `read()`, `write()` API로 ext4, NFS, /proc, /sys, 파이프, 소켓을 모두 다룰 수 있음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447665Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Files can be accessed across mounted filesystems transparently",
      "source_hash": 13531248888436260145,
      "context_hash": 6705104148298084661,
      "translation": "마운트된 여러 파일시스템에 걸쳐 파일에 투명하게 접근할 수 있음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Filesystems can be developed as kernel modules",
      "source_hash": 3332919344365472591,
      "context_hash": 12198883574873998929,
      "translation": "파일시스템을 커널 모듈로 개발할 수 있음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Kernel Modules": "커널 모듈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:46:06.447666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
